      "id": "claim_5340a52b04f54e1fa0db984d96cedf3f",
      "statement": "Makefile version resolution prefers GITHUB_REF tags (classifying -rc tags as release-candidates), falls back to git describe with a -dirty suffix, and finally to make/version.sh parsing .VERSION (default v0.0.0); the resolved version and UTC build date are injected via -ldflags -X main.Version/-X main.BuildTime, and DEBUG builds add -gcflags 'all=-N -l'.",
